BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:day1-sql-basics@data-analyst-prep
DTSTAMP:20260925T000000Z
DTSTART:20260925T090000Z
DTEND:20260925T110000Z
SUMMARY:Study Day 1: SQL Basics
DESCRIPTION:Cover SQL SELECT\, WHERE\, ORDER BY\, LIMIT. Solve 2 practice questions (0001\, 0002). Resources: SQLBolt SELECT\, W3Schools WHERE\, Mode Analytics SQL Tutorial.
LOCATION:Home / Office
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:day2-sql-joins@data-analyst-prep
DTSTAMP:20260926T000000Z
DTSTART:20260926T090000Z
DTEND:20260926T110000Z
SUMMARY:Study Day 2: SQL Joins & Subqueries
DESCRIPTION:Cover INNER\, LEFT\, RIGHT\, FULL joins and subqueries. Solve 3 practice questions (0003\, 0004\, 0005). Resources: SQL Joins Visualizer\, Mode Analytics Joins\, W3Schools Subqueries.
LOCATION:Home / Office
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:day3-sql-window@data-analyst-prep
DTSTAMP:20260927T000000Z
DTSTART:20260927T090000Z
DTEND:20260927T110000Z
SUMMARY:Study Day 3: SQL Window Functions\, Dates\, CASE WHEN
DESCRIPTION:Cover ROW_NUMBER\, RANK\, running totals\, date functions\, CASE WHEN. Solve 4 practice questions (0006\, 0007\, 0008\, 0009). Resources: Mode Analytics Window Functions\, SQLBolt Window Functions\, W3Schools CASE.
LOCATION:Home / Office
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:day4-python-pandas@data-analyst-prep
DTSTAMP:20260928T000000Z
DTSTART:20260928T090000Z
DTEND:20260928T110000Z
SUMMARY:Study Day 4: Python for Data Analysis
DESCRIPTION:Cover NumPy\, Pandas Series/DataFrame\, missing data handling. Solve 1 practice question (0010). Resources: NumPy Quickstart\, Pandas Getting Started\, Real Python Pandas.
LOCATION:Home / Office
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:day5-pandas-groupby@data-analyst-prep
DTSTAMP:20260929T000000Z
DTSTART:20260929T090000Z
DTEND:20260929T110000Z
SUMMARY:Study Day 5: Pandas GroupBy & Merge
DESCRIPTION:Cover groupby()\, merge()\, pivot_table(). Solve 2 practice questions (0011\, 0012). Resources: Pandas GroupBy\, Pandas Merging\, Real Python Merge.
LOCATION:Home / Office
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:day6-viz-stats@data-analyst-prep
DTSTAMP:20260930T000000Z
DTSTART:20260930T090000Z
DTEND:20260930T110000Z
SUMMARY:Study Day 6: Data Visualization & Statistics
DESCRIPTION:Cover Matplotlib\, Seaborn\, hypothesis testing\, A/B testing. Solve 2 practice questions (0013\, 0014). Resources: Matplotlib Quickstart\, Seaborn Tutorial\, Khan Academy A/B Testing.
LOCATION:Home / Office
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:day7-mock-interview@data-analyst-prep
DTSTAMP:20261001T000000Z
DTSTART:20261001T090000Z
DTEND:20261001T110000Z
SUMMARY:Study Day 7: SQL to Pandas & Mock Interview
DESCRIPTION:Cover SQL to Pandas equivalents\, read_sql\, to_sql. Solve 1 practice question (0015). Do a timed mock interview. Resources: Pandas SQL\, DataLemur\, StrataScratch.
LOCATION:Home / Office
END:VEVENT

END:VCALENDAR
